course: dictionary
lesson: 7241
title: Picker: someone or something that picks
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A picker is someone or something that picks. The word comes from pick plus -er, so a picker is the thing doing the picking. «You can pick up safe litter left by others with gloves or a litter picker.» A litter picker is a grabbing tool for rubbish, so it is the picker here.
explain: Pickers can be people or machines. «Warehouse robots carry whole shelves or boxes to human pickers» tells you the human pickers are workers, because the word human is there to show that the robots are different. Always check the sentence to see who or what is meant.
explain: Be careful with «cherry picker». «A cherry picker lifts workers on a platform at the end of a folding hydraulic arm.» It has nothing to do with cherries. The clues platform, lifts and workers show it is a machine that raises people high.
fact: A picker is a person or tool that picks or chooses something.
fact: A fruit picker picks fruit, vegetables or flowers on a farm, often as a seasonal job.
fact: A litter picker is a grabbing tool for collecting rubbish safely.
fact: In a warehouse, a picker collects items to fill orders.
fact: A cherry picker is a machine with a platform that lifts workers high. It does not pick cherries.
exercise: «You can pick up safe litter left by others with gloves or a litter picker.» What is a litter picker? | A farm worker who picks fruit | Birds that eat rubbish | *A grabbing tool for collecting rubbish safely | A tall platform that lifts workers
exercise: «Warehouse robots carry whole shelves or boxes to human pickers.» Who are the pickers here? | *Workers who collect items for orders in a warehouse | Robots that carry shelves | Birds that eat fruit in the warehouse | Farmers who grow cherries
exercise: «A cherry picker lifts workers on a platform.» Is a cherry picker a fruit picker? | Yes, it picks cherries from trees | No, it is a box for storing cherries | *No, it is a machine that lifts workers high | Yes, it is a farm worker who picks fruit
test: A fruit picker works on a farm. What do they pick? | *Fruit | Books | Rubbish from the streets | Cars
test: What is the main job of a litter picker? | *Collecting rubbish safely with a grabber | Lifting people high | Painting walls | Cooking dinner
exam: In «a cherry picker lifts workers on a platform», what is the cherry picker? | *A machine that lifts workers high | A bird that eats cherries | A fruit tree in an orchard | A farm worker who picks fruit
